@startuml UC12_Download_Analytics_Activity_Diagram

title UC12: Download Analytics - Activity Diagram

start
:User selects "Download" option;
:System displays format options (JSON, CSV, PDF);
:User selects desired format;
:System converts report to selected format;

if (File size acceptable?) then (yes)
  :System initiates download;
  :User receives file;
  stop
else (large file)
  :System sends download link via email;
  :User can download from link later;
  stop
endif

@enduml
